        "guard:b2->i5",
        "action:i5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if you choose to abort, the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the abort choice, the corresponding action state, and the process termination on the failure/retry decision path."
    },
